::warning file=domain/entities.go,line=10,col=1,title=W031 definition provenance unknown::public.active_users exists, and there is no record of this project having applied its definition%0A%0Adefinition drift is detected by comparing what PostgreSQL made of the definition when a migration applied it against what it says now. Without the first of those there is nothing to compare, so the body of this relation is unverified — it may be the declared one, and nothing here can tell%0A%0AFix: apply public.active_users through a migration so its definition is recorded. Until then its body is not checked
